# The LLVM/MLIR revision llvm-dsdl links against.
#
# This is the cache key for the toolchain image, and it is a semantic input to
# the generated code: EmitC output varies across MLIR majors, and this project
# pins byte-reproducibility to one. See docs/reference/guarantees/supply-chain.md.
#
# Changing this line rebuilds the toolchain. Nothing else does.
llvmorg-22.1.8
